  <item>
    <title>vol.31 2025脱口秀综艺大观察</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68f1f3b42265473020f33876</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68f1f3b42265473020f33876</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Oct 2025 08:01:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;不知道大家看没看今年脱口秀最让人期待的两档综艺节目《脱口秀和他的朋友们第二季》以及《喜剧之王单口季第二季》。作为目前国内最出圈的两档脱口秀综艺，一经播出便经常喜提各类热搜，不过我跟同样是平时有事没事爱看一些综艺喜剧的小黑老师对比都有同样的观感，今年的节目整体都有那么一丢丢～不对劲。小黑老师也是许久未见，这次被我薅来一起聊了聊关于这两档节目我们的看法。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家听得开心，理性交流。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：牟犇</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：小黑</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：象牙山牟村拓哉</span></p><span></span><p><span>Playlist：MGMT—Time to Pretend</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:00:40</a> 小黑老师去哪儿了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">00:03:30</a> 锐评喜单第二季</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">00:08:20</a> 强力选手站台，女性话题突出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">00:12:00</a> 翟佳宁老师夺冠引发网络争议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">00:18:00</a> 都是我们惹不起的人- -</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">00:20:30</a> 脱友的评委老师们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">00:23:00</a> 火出圈的房主任再惹争议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">00:28:00</a> 平台引流，制造对抗氛围</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1932">00:32:12</a> 笑中带泪是高级的形式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">00:38:40</a> 小黑老师喜欢的脱口秀演员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2840">00:47:20</a> 小小总结</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/614ae6035824041bec677c21/lma68XdKxXSQgykbY-gN-HQEzWt5.m4a" length="106043394" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpTeVWXnOPWDg2EBqe4wObgKSyyA.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.30 大学神婆老师与宠物殡葬师的一期“玄”聊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67db024bdd11f9c8c1c8e8fe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67db024bdd11f9c8c1c8e8fe</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Mar 2025 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不知道大家曾经是否对算命、占卜、星座、塔罗等等感兴趣</span></p><span></span><p><span>经过我的个人观察，越来越多年轻人在拼命和认命之间选择了算命</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为一个玄学重度发烧友，算命这事儿肯定少不了我</span></p><span></span><p><span>不管是六爻还是塔罗还有八字曾经都找各路大师（当然也有江湖骗子）算过</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目，我们找来了对算命占卜颇有研究的一位大学老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>以及身为宠物殡葬师的喵喵</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起来聊聊关于玄学的那些事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>声明：本期节目观点仅代表嘉宾个人观点，请各位听众遵从科学，理性收听</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：牟犇</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：喵喵、珊姐</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：滑骨绵掌牟先森</span></p><span></span><p><span>playlist:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Envy - Rhythm</span></p><span></span><p><span>timeline:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">00:03:40</a> 珊半仙儿给主播算命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="532">00:08:52</a> 算命有忌讳吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">00:13:28</a> 宠物殡葬一天干点啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">00:19:30</a> 给离世宠物烧点啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1358">00:22:38</a> 六道轮回说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">00:26:00</a> 不是每个人都能干殡葬行业啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1643">00:27:23</a> 关于宠物殡葬那些无法解释的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2011">00:33:31</a> 总能梦见离世亲人的珊姐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2150">00:35:50</a> 主播诡异新遭遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">00:39:00</a> 珊姐连着五天梦见“大仙儿”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">00:48:40</a> 珊姐同事泰国恐怖遭遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3195">00:53:15</a> 跟各位一起“但行好事，莫问前程”</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/614ae6035824041bec677c21/lg-MBV5RXuoIKy0DOoQENoSo4cli.m4a" length="117880296" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:03</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmRg8owS5M8g5gWuNpEQIFTNW1Kx.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.29 友情消亡史：一场没有凶手的谋杀案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d18ef70766616acd7aa3be</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d18ef70766616acd7aa3be</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Mar 2025 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>还记得你年少时最好的那个朋友吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：牟犇</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：喵喵、小白</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：滑骨绵掌牟先森</span></p><span></span><p><span>playlist:</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈奕迅 - 最佳损友</span></p><span></span><p><span>timeline:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">00:02:00</a> 正儿八经的好朋友到底是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="429">00:07:09</a> 过往的朋友们总归慢慢就不联系了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">00:08:20</a> 我跟我闺蜜初中共享男友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">00:10:45</a> 主播跟朋友闹掰回忆杀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">00:18:30</a> 我说兄弟，他说对不起您还不是我的好友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1302">00:21:42</a> 莫名其妙失联的朋友&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">00:26:10</a> 反正每次都得讲喵总跟前男友吵架现场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1745">00:29:05</a> 好友突然谈了个对象但是你很反感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1881">00:31:21</a> 庆幸我们还有好朋友在身边</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2870">00:47:50</a> 离开我们的好朋友还要挽回吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">00:50:30</a> 新来的我们欢迎，离开的我们欢送，谢谢你们</span></p>]]></description>
