  <item>
    <title>vol.27 被出轨、被规训、最后再来说说生育</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d8f2a900ca19a60008199b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d8f2a900ca19a60008199b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 24 Feb 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>继上集喵总回忆完职场油腻男之后</span></p><span></span><p><span>这位台柱子最近吃饱喝足，养精蓄锐</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期火力全开</span></p><span></span><p><span>追忆被出轨真实经历，怒喷出轨男不堪一面</span></p><span></span><p><span>接着聊到社会对于男性的规训，以及所谓的男人味儿到底是个什么东西</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后在友好轻松的氛围下，给我和小白好好上了一堂生育课</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家听得开心，希望男士们共勉！</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜欢这档播客的话也希望你动动小手点个订阅点个赞，这对我确实很重要！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家评论区踊跃留言与我们大家一起讨论！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：牟犇</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：喵喵、小白</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：滑骨绵掌牟先森</span></p><span></span><p><span>playlist:</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Last Dinner Party - Caesar on a TV Screen</span></p><span></span><p><span>timeline:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:00:38</a> 喵总掏心窝子时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">00:02:15</a> 警方叫你，是已经找到了一些证据</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">00:02:45</a> 男女思维差异害死人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">00:08:00</a> 喵总详解出轨男</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1349">00:22:29</a> 大步流星，潇洒前行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1483">00:24:43</a> 总有可能不再喜欢伴侣，但请诚实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1735">00:28:55</a> 男性被潜移默化不断规训</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">00:30:00</a> 男孩哭了就是娘炮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2170">00:36:10</a> 男孩化妆就是娘炮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">00:40:00</a> 真正的男子气概是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2609">00:43:29</a> 为啥现在这么多人不愿意结婚生育</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">00:50:00</a> 拒绝内耗，自信独立</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liJ4RDXekyvf9tjxLUq2cOKtskEg.m4a" length="108114193" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:00</itunes:duration>
