  <item>
    <title>vol.25 三人行狂唠一波关于春节那点事儿</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65cb941d0bef6c2074e0e86e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65cb941d0bef6c2074e0e86e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 Feb 2024 16:09:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>亲爱的听众朋友们！我想死你们啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>首先在这里祝大家新春愉快！阖家欢乐！身体健康！龙年大吉！财源广进！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这不是一到过年，身边的好朋友陆陆续续回到了家乡，值此新春佳节，必须强制性拉过来，好好唠一唠关于过年这事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天有大家熟悉的喵喵同学，以及一位新朋友：小白</span></p><span></span><p><span>不知道各位最近过年都玩得如何？有没有顺利应对七大姑八大姨的灵魂质询？催婚这档子事情怎么防御的？为啥以前过年比现在好玩儿呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期不妨听听二位嘉宾是如何口吐莲花，来一波关于过往春节的回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家听得开心，有任何关于春节的回忆欢迎评论区留言大家一起开心讨论~</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：牟犇</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：喵喵、小白</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：滑骨绵掌牟先森</span></p><span></span><p><span>playlist:</span></p><span></span><p><span>张蔷 - 我的八十年代</span></p><span></span><p><span>timeline:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">00:03:15</a> 还没闹翻的朋友挺不容易</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">00:05:05</a> 我吧，就是没朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">00:09:55</a> 有些亲戚真是让人讨厌啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">00:16:20</a> 当然还是有真正关心你的亲戚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">00:20:20</a> 父母得跟我们一起对抗世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">00:22:40</a> 东亚父母好谦虚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">00:29:50</a> 小时候放炮好玩，现在??好玩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">00:31:30</a> 小时候过年真是美好回忆啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">00:37:30</a> 压岁钱？妈帮你存着！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2385">00:39:45</a> 小时候压岁钱都花哪儿了啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">00:52:00</a> 朋友的定义跟过去真是千差万别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3310">00:55:10</a> 古惑仔是万恶之源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3485">00:58:05</a> 浅浅唠唠春晚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">00:59:00</a> 谢天谢地春晚没有科目三</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3605">01:00:05</a> 关于艺术作品高低的一场讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4146">01:09:06</a> 集体给大家~拜！年！啦！</span></p>]]></description>
