    <title>vol.18 造梦师与世界の光</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6432a64966e4c00c6a9dd3f0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6432a64966e4c00c6a9dd3f0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Apr 2023 11:49:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>前阵子昭和系奥特曼、手镯之王、昭和最惨、最帅人间体，</span></p><span></span><p><span>杰克奥特曼的扮演者团时郎先生永远地离开了我们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>相信老先生去往了自己的m78星云，回到光之国继续担任奥特之星支部长。</span></p><span></span><p><span>而杰克作为本人童年看过的第一个奥特曼，记忆深刻难以忘怀，</span></p><span></span><p><span>造型虽然比不上后期的奥特曼那么精致令人印象深刻，</span></p><span></span><p><span>但仍然给孩子们带去了无数的光与希望（除了有几集根本不是子供向还挺吓人以外）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们请到恐怖片迷，特摄迷，直到现在还在一直坚持追番观看奥特曼的文哥，</span></p><span></span><p><span>带大家一起重返乡队员的故乡——遥远的m78星云。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从奥特曼的前传开始，到昭和奥特兄弟、平成三杰，最后到新时代奥特曼种种特点，</span></p><span></span><p><span>以及圆谷英二为什么是孩子们的造梦师？</span></p><span></span><p><span>奥特曼到底是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们保护的到底是地球还是人类？</span></p><span></span><p><span>炎头队长佐菲才是最大幕后黑手？</span></p><span></span><p><span>奥特曼为啥人均三分钟？</span></p><span></span><p><span>文哥在本期节目中将会为大家一一解答。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家听得开心。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：牟犇</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：小文哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：滑骨绵掌牟先森</span></p><span></span><p><span>永远的奥特曼 - LINE</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="184">00:03:04</a> / 到底什么是奥特曼</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="278">00:04:38</a> / 奥特之父圆谷英二&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">00:05:08</a> / 奥特Q与初代登场</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">00:07:25</a> / 昭和奥特曼排序</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">00:08:08</a> / 炎头队长来历</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">00:09:10</a> / 特摄技术引领时代</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">00:09:55</a> / 童年的第一部属于杰克</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">00:11:36</a> / 初代和七爷</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1159">00:19:19</a> / 奥特曼为什么总是三分钟</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1229">00:20:29</a> / 造梦师圆谷英二</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1403">00:23:23</a> / 最帅人间体乡秀树</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">00:32:00</a> / 童年阴影法王艾斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2425">00:40:25</a> / 欢乐太子爷泰罗登场</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">00:41:30</a> / 怎么哪都有你啊佐菲</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2624">00:43:44</a> / 男子汉成长史雷欧</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2660">00:44:20</a> / 赛文阴谋论？</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2960">00:49:20</a> / 你的眼泪能拯救地球吗&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3270">00:54:30</a> / 昭和三大问题作</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3810">01:03:30</a> / 光之战士迪迦</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4109">01:08:29</a> / 人人都可以成为奥特曼</span></p><span></span><p><span>⊿ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3810">01:03:30</a> / &nbsp;🎵 永远的奥特曼 - LINE</span></p>]]></description>
